      <title>中国科学家提出新设想：把废弃煤矿改造成地下农业实验室</title>
      <link>https://index.zshipu.com/climate/post/20260912/%E4%B8%AD%E5%9B%BD%E7%A7%91%E5%AD%A6%E5%AE%B6%E6%8F%90%E5%87%BA%E6%96%B0%E8%AE%BE%E6%83%B3%E6%8A%8A%E5%BA%9F%E5%BC%83%E7%85%A4%E7%9F%BF%E6%94%B9%E9%80%A0%E6%88%90%E5%9C%B0%E4%B8%8B%E5%86%9C%E4%B8%9A%E5%AE%9E%E9%AA%8C%E5%AE%A4/</link>
